I go into the bedroom.
There is a bed in the bedroom.
Near the bed, there is a wooden wardrobe.
I take the suitcase near the cupboard.
I open the suitcase.
My clothes are in the suitcase.
I take out the clothes.
I place my shirts in the wooden wardrobe.
Some clothes are on the bed.
I place them in the wardrobe too.
The clothes are well placed in the wardrobe.
Now the suitcase is empty.
I slide the empty suitcase under the bed.
The suitcase is under the bed.
The suitcase is properly placed.
The bedroom is beautiful now.
Now everything is in its place.
